<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA FOURTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA FOURTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the first</p>
<p>day of the fourth test between England and Australia at</p>
<p>Headingley on Thursday:</p>
<p>England first innings</p>
<p>M.Butcher c Blewett b Reiffel  24</p>
<p> M.Atherton not out		 34</p>
<p>A.Stewart c Blewett b Gillespie 7</p>
<p> N.Hussain c Taylor b McGrath   26</p>
<p> D.Headley not out		   0</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-1 w-1 nb-9)     15</p>
<p> Total (for three wickets)     106</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-43 2-58 3-103</p>
<p>To bat: G.Thorpe, J.Crawley, M.Ealham, R.Croft, D.Gough,</p>
<p>M.Smith.</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): McGrath 13-1-43-1, Reiffel 13-2-25-1,</p>
<p>Gillespie 6-0-14-1, Blewett 3-0-17-0, Warne 1-0-2-0.</p>
<p>Australia - M.Taylor (captain ), M.Elliott, G.Blewett,</p>
<p>M.Waugh, S.Waugh, R.Ponting, I.Healy, S.Warne, P.Reiffel,</p>
<p>J.Gillespie, G.McGrath.</p>
